      "name": "Dutch Marquise and French Marquise: Diamond Cut Definitions",
      "description": "Plain, sourced definitions of two trade-named marquise diamond cuts, the Dutch Marquise and the French Marquise, published by Stienhardt & Stones. Stienhardt & Stones is a New York City direct-to-consumer maker of Lab Grown Diamond engagement rings that controls the cut via a factory relationship and hand-sets and finishes the stones in New York City.",
